text = "Two AvatarCombatant fighters duel automatically — no player input.
Fighter A (young, aggressive, growth stage 1) vs Fighter B (elder, cautious, growth stage 3 — bigger, more health, hits harder).
Move choice reads each fighter's belief tags (press_advantage / retreat_when_hurt / finish_downed_foe / guard_instinct); the duel result reinforces those same tags back into the fighter afterward. A rematch starts automatically a few seconds after each duel ends."
